    "sections": {
        "description": "Minimalist Blog Theme. Minimal Blog Nova is a free, minimalist WordPress theme designed for simplicity, elegance, and performance. As a Full Site Editing (FSE) theme, it is fully compatible with the latest Gutenberg block editor, offering seamless customization and complete design flexibility. Its ultra-responsive layout ensures your blog looks stunning on all devices, while the clean, modern aesthetic keeps the focus squarely on your content. Whether you're a writer, poet, book author, or tech enthusiast, Minimal Blog Nova offers a distraction-free, typographic design that enhances storytelling and reading experience. With beautiful typography and thoughtful white space, it’s perfect for anyone who values minimalism—ideal for personal blogs, coding journals, or any content-first site. Simply write and publish; Minimal Blog Nova takes care of the rest, allowing your words and ideas to shine without visual clutter."
    },
